1y-full.log; ls -t /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/a11y-report | head -1\",\"description\":\"Progress peek\"}\n[tool read_bash -> success] args={\"delay\":600,\"shellId\":\"fullaudit\"}\n[tool read_bash -> success] args={\"delay\":600,\"shellId\":\"fullaudit\"}\n[tool read_bash -> success] args={\"delay\":600,\"shellId\":\"fullaudit\"}\n[assistant] Full run complete. Import and regenerate.\n[tool bash -> success] args={\"command\":\"cd /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken && vp exec node docs/scripts/accessibility-evidence.ts a11y-report/2026-10-28T18-16-06.299Z 2>&1 | tail -2; vp run @pantoken/docs#docs:api:css 2>&1 | tail -1; for p in agent-shell banner button-set logo segmented-control skeleton-loader; do echo $p $(grep -c \\\"pantoken-a11y-table\\\" docs/api/css/$p.md) $(grep -c \\\"not audited\\\\|Not audited\\\" docs/api/css/$p.md); done; grep -n \\\"notAudited\\\" -A2 docs/.vitepress/i18n.ts | head -4; git status --short\",\"description\":\"Import and verify pages\",\"initial_wait\":240}\n[tool bash -> success] args={\"command\":\"cd /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken && cat .changeset/accessibility-audit-section.md; git diff --stat docs/public/accessibility/results.json | tail -1\",\"description\":\"Changeset format\"}","copilot_cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral"}},{"content":"ALLOW: Changeset creation is specifically within the authorized remediation task.","refusal":null,"role":"assistant","reasoning_opaque":"REDACTED","reasoning_text":"**Evaluating changeset creation**\n\nI need to evaluate the proposed action of creating a changeset file. The user has authorized incremental commits, but this file is just a draft and isn't mandatory. There’s some confusion because the transcript suggests that the tool to create was already executed, yet the proposed action seems to run afterward. However, since the human delegated this task, it feels like I should proceed with writing the file, targeting the appropriate path in the project.","encrypted_content":"","reasoningBlocks":{"p